# Excerpt from /tmp/akiko_dbg.log on the Retro Remake SuperStation,
# 2026-09-26, Chuck Rock (1994).chd, captured while the title hung on the
# CD32 splash. Copied verbatim from the capture (cf1.log lines 133-142) --
# not reconstructed. It is the run that identified the command-channel
# desync: two phantom all-zero frames, then the BIOS's INFO command
# arriving behind a stray LED checksum byte.
#
# tests/replay_akiko_log.cpp re-runs the framing over the bytes= fields.
# Lines beginning with # are comments and are ignored by the parser.

