[  4212.383039] [akiko] CMD op=0x02 n=2 bytes=f2 0d
[  4215.038881] [akiko] CHECKSUM FAIL n=2 expected=2 sum=00 bytes=00 00
[  4215.039194] [akiko] CHECKSUM FAIL n=2 expected=2 sum=00 bytes=00 00
[  4215.039452] [akiko] CHECKSUM FAIL n=3 expected=3 sum=e9 bytes=ea 27 d8
